# PROJECT: THE LAST SIGNAL
## An Immersive Psychological Horror Hackathon Experience

Act as a world-class creative developer, senior full-stack engineer, horror game designer, UI/UX designer, and cinematic motion designer.

Build a complete, functional, immersive, horror-themed hackathon web application called "THE LAST SIGNAL".

This must NOT look like a typical hackathon registration website. It must feel like a playable psychological horror escape-room game inspired by abandoned research facilities, analog horror, found-footage horror, supernatural mysteries, and cinematic survival games.

The user should feel as if they have entered a haunted facility through their computer.

The central gameplay concept is:

"You entered to solve the mystery. Now find a way out."

Every room, navigation action, interaction, and discovery should deepen the atmosphere of fear. The user must explore the facility, encounter paranormal events, solve puzzles, discover the story, and escape.

Build a real, working application rather than a static visual mockup.

